  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/532e89c0aab03f5d4320a96257e964503a16f957ab5db2ce94614ba262f6a98d.png] \n\nOption 1) −, −, =, ×, +, ÷\n\nInterchanging the * with mathematical signs,\n\nWe get: 37 - 3 - 21 = 79 × 18 + __**4 ÷ 19**__\n\n⇒ 37 - 3 - 21 = __**79 × 18 **__+ 0.210\n\n⇒ 37 - 3 - 21 = __**1422 + 0.210**__\n\n⇒ __**37 - 3 - 2**__1 ≠ 1422.21\n\n⇒ **13 ≠ 1422.21**\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 2) ×, +, −, =, ×, − \n\nInterchanging the * with mathematical signs,\n\nWe get: __**37 × 3**__ + 21 - 79 = __**18 × 4 **__- 19\n\n⇒ __**111 + 21 **__- 79 =__ __72 - 19\n\n⇒ __**132 - 79**__ = __72 - 19__\n\n⇒ **53 = 53 **\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) +, ×, −, =, +, − \n\nInterchanging the * with mathematical signs,\n\nWe get: 37 + __**3 × 21**__ - 79 = 18 + 4 - 19\n\n⇒ __**37 + 63 **__- 79 = __18 + 4__ - 19\n\n⇒ __**100 - **____**79**__ = __**22 - 19**__\n\n⇒ **21 ≠ 3**\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 4) =, −, ×, +, −, × \n\nInterchanging the * with mathematical signs,\n\nWe get: 37 = 3 - __**21 × 79**__ + 18 -__** 4 × 19**__\n\n⇒ 37 = __**3**__ - 1659 __**+ 18**__ - 76\n\n⇒ 37 =__** 21 - 1659 -76**__\n\n⇒ 37 = __**21 - 1735**__\n\n⇒ **37 ≠ -1714** \n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****×, +, −, =, ×, −** **\"**.",
